---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <main class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Last Updated: January 2025</p>

      <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-sm text-slate-700 space-y-6">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p>Rofix Service ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our website or use our RO repair and service.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>When you book a service with us, we may collect the following information:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>Your full name</li>
            <li>Mobile number</li>
            <li>Pin code / service address</li>
            <li>RO brand and model information</li>
            <li>Any additional details you provide in the service form</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>We use the collected information to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>Schedule and provide RO repair and maintenance services</li>
            <li>Contact you regarding your service request</li>
            <li>Send service reminders and updates</li>
            <li>Improve our services and customer experience</li>
            <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Data Protection</h2>
          <p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">5. Sharing Your Information</h2>
          <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information with our authorized technicians solely for the purpose of providing the requested service.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">6. Cookies</h2>
          <p>Our website may use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your browsing experience and analyze website traffic. You can control cookie settings through your browser preferences.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">7. Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these external sites.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">8. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal information. To exercise these rights, please contact us at the number below.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">9. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p>
          <p class="mt-2"><strong>Rofix Service</strong><br>Phone: +91-7090170092<br>Location: Bangalore, Karnataka</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>